== building one ==
  after inserting   {0, 1, 2, 3, 4}
  after removing at {1, 2, 3, 4}
  removing a 3      true
  removing a 99     false
  what is left      {1, 2, 4}
  repeats are fine  {1, 1, 2, 2}
  one of each       {1, 2}
  and the original  {1, 1, 2, 2}
== asking ==
  how many      3
  any milk      true
  where is milk 1
  any jam       false
  where is jam  -1
  the first one bread
== a run of it ==
  from 2 on     {30, 40, 50}
  from 1 to 3   {20, 30}
  the two halves put back together: {10, 20, 30, 40, 50}
  and the original is untouched     {10, 20, 30, 40, 50}
== two together ==
  both piles     {1, 2, 3, 3, 4, 5}
  in both        {3}
  only mine      {1, 2}
  only yours     {4, 5}
  every element back, reordered: {3, 1, 2}
  and mine is untouched {1, 2, 3}
  merged, not appended  {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}
== the same words on a string ==
  how many        7
  any 'fi'        true
  where is 'fi'   3
  from 5 on       -C
  from 0 to 5     Profi
  five characters Profi
== a set changes, a string does not ==
  the set changed      {1, 2, 3}
  the new string       hello, world
  the original one     hello
  without the middle   a-c
  without the first    bc
  with something in it abc
  trimmed              [padded]
== between the two ==
  split into words   {"the", "quick", "brown", "fox"}
  joined again       the quick brown fox
  as characters      {'a', 'b', 'c'}
  how many words     4
  numbers joined     1 then 2 then 3
== dropping the gaps ==
  as they came    {empty, 1, empty, 2, empty}
  ends trimmed    {1, empty, 2}
  start only      {1, empty, 2, empty}
  every gap gone  {1, 2}
  and no unwrapping needed: 3
